00:26:33,750 --> 00:26:38,420
精神对身体的作用能够到什么程度。
on how far such a mind-body effect could go.

485
00:26:42,190 --> 00:26:46,350
如果冥想能控制我们的身体的恒温器，
If meditation could control our body's thermostat,

