492
00:27:06,650 --> 00:27:09,440
这些压力激素接下来的作用
A secondary effect of these stress hormones

493
00:27:09,550 --> 00:27:13,580
就是引发细胞炎症，
is to cause inflammation in cells.

494
00:27:13,690 --> 00:27:17,650
如果细胞长时间发炎，
If cells become inflamed for prolonged periods,

