00:27:20,460 --> 00:27:25,300
如心脏病、关节炎和节段性回肠炎(克罗恩病)。
like heart disease, arthritis, and Crohn's disease.

497
00:27:27,870 --> 00:27:32,300
Herbert以此开发出了一种为其8周的治疗方案，
So Herbert developed an eight-week therapy

498
00:27:32,410 --> 00:27:35,030
每天冥想15分钟，
designed to combat stress,

