00:34:18,980 --> 00:34:21,470
他就能够改正错误的等式。
he can correct the equation.

608
00:34:21,580 --> 00:34:26,740
通过这种规律，他解决了好几个问题，
Applying the same pattern, he solves several more puzzles.

