00:37:37,270 --> 00:37:41,960
一个错误说不定就摧毁了一辆同盟补给车辆，
where one mistake could mean destroying an allied aid vehicle

631
00:37:42,070 --> 00:37:44,000
而不是敌方炮兵卡车。
instead of an enemy artillery truck.

