then he would use transcranial direct current stimulation

652
00:38:49,870 --> 00:38:54,000
增强学员的脑部该区域的活性，
to amplify the activity in that region of the trainees' brains

653
00:38:54,110 --> 00:38:57,030
来看看他是否会学得更快。
and see whether it made them faster learners.

654
00:38:57,550 --> 00:39:00,100
脑部扫描中有一件事是非常明显的，
One of the things that's quite obvious in the scans

655
00:39:00,220 --> 00:39:03,070
那就是当你还是个新手时，
is that, when you are a novice,

656
00:39:03,190 --> 00:39:07,780
内侧颞叶的活性很低，
there's low-level activation in the medial temporal lobes.

657
00:39:07,890 --> 00:39:11,350
但对于专业人员来说，这里活性水平非常高。
But in experts, there's very high-level activation.

658
00:39:11,460 --> 00:39:14,620
所以我们把TDCS的刺激目标定位这些区域，
And so we targeted TDCS at these areas

659
00:39:14,730 --> 00:39:19,090
通过提高这部分的活跃程度来加快训练速度。
that increase activity in order to accelerate training.

660
00:39:19,200 --> 00:39:22,930
学员一戴上TDCS装置后，
Once the TDCS headgear is in place

661
00:39:23,040 --> 00:39:24,890
但装置还没打开，
but not yet turned on,

