00:39:38,090 --> 00:39:41,860
就像这个例子中的敌方火箭发射车。
in this case, an enemy rocket launcher.

667
00:39:52,030 --> 00:39:56,560
这绝对是一类识别类型的实验，
This is definitely a pattern recognition type of experiment.

668
00:39:56,670 --> 00:39:59,430
这些地方，用黄色圆圈标记的，
Here, where there are yellow circles,

669
00:39:59,540 --> 00:40:02,570
是图像中真正的目标，
those show the real targets in the image.

670
00:40:02,680 --> 00:40:06,100
而单独的红色圆圈(没有黄色圆圈一起圈出来的)是
Where there are red circles with no yellow,

671
00:40:06,220 --> 00:40:10,110
这个例子中学员做出的错误决定，
those are incorrect choices, and so, in this case,

