00:40:10,220 --> 00:40:14,780
他做出了一个正确决定和两个错误决定。
there was one correct choice and two incorrect choices.

673
00:40:15,890 --> 00:40:19,220
接下来，Michael开始用TDCS
Next, Michael applies TDCS

